<Role id="{0056ef01-01e8-f111-84ea-002248db5401}" name="Change Radar User" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance">
  <IsCustomizable>1</IsCustomizable>
  <IsAutoAssigned>0</IsAutoAssigned>
  <Description>Uses Change Radar: reads every Change Radar table, and changes what the pages and forms let people act on: an exposure's status (confirm or dismiss), an assessment's override, a signal's Watched flag, and a fingerprint's review status. Can't change settings, rules, vocabulary, feeds or subscriptions.</Description>
